{% block content %}
<section class="cust-hero">
    <div class="cust-hero-inner">
        <h1 class="cust-hero-headline">
            <span>The teams</span>
            <span>that ship secure.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="cust-hero-subline">
            Banks, insurers, KRITIS operators, and OEMs run continuous validation with VORNAC. In their own words — and the logos to back it up.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="logo-wall">
    <div class="logo-wall-inner">
        <h2 class="logo-wall-headline">
            Security teams in regulated industries — <em>across the DACH region</em>.
        </h2>
        <div class="logo-grid">
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/client-zeiss.png" alt="Carl Zeiss"></div>
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/client-1.png" alt="mbits"></div>
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/client-pfitzenmeier.png" alt="Pfitzenmeier"></div>
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/logo_ipcrew.png" alt="IP Crew"></div>
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/client-3.png" alt="Instaffo"></div>
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/client-refundrebel.png" alt="RefundRebel"></div>
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/client-2.png" alt="Knooing"></div>
            <div class="logo-cell"><img src="/client-5.png" alt="Tilko"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="quotes">
    <div class="quotes-inner">
        <header class="quotes-header">
            <h2 class="quotes-headline">
                Why C-Level in regulated industries <em>switched to continuous validation</em>.
            </h2>
        </header>
        <div class="quotes-grid">

            <article class="quote-card">
                <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
                <p class="quote-text">We build software for hospitals — security isn't optional, it's mandatory. Our partners need to meet the same bar for quality and reliability that we set for ourselves. VORNAC clears both. Instead of one-off engagements, we get continuous testing at our development pace, findings we can act on directly, and full visibility into our security posture at any time. A partner that thinks alongside us — and one we can confidently recommend to our healthcare customers.</p>
                <div class="quote-attribution">
                    <span class="quote-name">Michael Müller</span>
                    <span class="quote-role">CEO</span>
                    <span class="quote-company">mbits GmbH · Healthcare Software</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="quote-card">
                <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
                <p class="quote-text">Test results flow straight into our internal ticketing system. Findings are prioritized by technical severity. Our engineering team works through them as regular development tasks. The exact technical write-ups eliminate long alignment rounds on reproducing the bug.</p>
                <div class="quote-attribution">
                    <span class="quote-name">Nikolai Gulatz</span>
                    <span class="quote-role">CIO</span>
                    <span class="quote-company">Instaffo GmbH · HR Tech</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="quote-card">
                <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
                <p class="quote-text">VORNAC's licensing runs on flat-rate access. We bake security spend into the budget for every new software module from day one. Unlimited test runs let us plan precise budgets for our mid-market clients.</p>
                <div class="quote-attribution">
                    <span class="quote-name">Bernhard Gauß</span>
                    <span class="quote-role">Geschäftsführer</span>
                    <span class="quote-company">IP-Crew GmbH · IT Services</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="quote-card">
                <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
                <p class="quote-text">As a Wi-Fi and network specialist, we build the infrastructure our customers run their business on. That responsibility doesn't end with the rollout. With VORNAC we have a partner that tests our networks continuously and autonomously — not once a year, but ongoing. We see risks before they become problems, and we can give our customers verifiable proof that the networks we run are operated securely.</p>
                <div class="quote-attribution">
                    <span class="quote-name">Christopher Wesch</span>
                    <span class="quote-role">Geschäftsführer</span>
                    <span class="quote-company">tilko GmbH · Network Infrastructure</span>
                </div>
            </article>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="cust-cta">
    <div class="cust-cta-inner">
        <h2 class="cust-cta-headline">
            See what continuous validation <em>looks like</em> in your environment.
        </h2>
        <p class="cust-cta-sub">
            30-minute session with our team. No procurement gymnastics.
        </p>
        <a href="{{ site.contact.bookDemo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cust-cta-btn">
            Book a demo
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
                <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/>
            </svg>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
